{
  "package": {
    "name": "Connected Service: Microsoft Entra ID",
    "revision": 1,
    "requires": {
      "cerb_version": "12.0.0",
      "plugins": []
    },
    "library": {
      "name": "Microsoft Entra ID",
      "uri": "cerb_connected_service_microsoft_entra",
      "description": "OAuth2 with Microsoft Entra ID (Microsoft 365 mail)",
      "instructions": "# Instructions\r\n\r\n* See [**Cerb + Azure**](https://cerb.ai/solutions/integrations/azure/)\r\n* In [Microsoft Entra](https://entra.microsoft.com/), open **Applications » App registrations** and register an app\r\n* Set its redirect URI to `https://YOUR-CERB-HOSTNAME/oauth/callback` (no trailing slash; include `/index.php` if your URLs use it)\r\n* Copy the **Application (client) ID** and **Directory (tenant) ID** from the app's Overview\r\n* In **Certificates & secrets**, add a client secret and copy its **Value** (not the Secret ID)\r\n* Enter those below\r\n\r\nThe `offline_access` scope is required for Cerb to refresh the access token every hour. Client secrets expire in 6 months by default, so plan to rotate them.\r\n\r\n# Next steps\r\n\r\nAfter this package is imported, create a connected account from **Search » Connected Accounts** and link it to your Microsoft 365 account. Then select that account in the **XOAuth2** field of your email transport (`smtp.office365.com:587`, TLS) and mailbox (`outlook.office365.com:993`, IMAP), leaving their passwords blank.\r\n\r\nSee: [**Authenticate an Office365 mailbox using XOAUTH2**](https://cerb.ai/guides/integrations/azure/o365-xoauth/)",
      "point": "connected_service",
      "image": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    "configure": {
      "placeholders": [],
      "prompts": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Client ID",
          "key": "prompt_client_id",
          "params": {
            "default": "",
            "placeholder": "(paste your Application (client) ID)"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Client Secret",
          "key": "prompt_client_secret",
          "params": {
            "default": "",
            "placeholder": "(paste your Client Secret value)"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Directory ID",
          "key": "prompt_directory_id",
          "params": {
            "default": "",
            "placeholder": "(paste your Directory (tenant) ID)"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Scope",
          "key": "prompt_scope",
          "params": {
            "default": "email openid offline_access https://outlook.office.com/IMAP.AccessAsUser.All https://outlook.office.com/SMTP.Send",
            "placeholder": "(space-delimited scopes)"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "records": [
    {
      "uid": "service_microsoft_entra",
      "_context": "connected_service",
      "name": "Microsoft Entra ID",
      "extension_id": "cerb.service.provider.oauth2",
      "params": {
        "grant_type": "authorization_code",
        "client_id": "{{{prompt_client_id}}}",
        "client_secret": "{{{prompt_client_secret}}}",
        "authorization_url": "https://login.microsoftonline.com/{{{prompt_directory_id}}}/oauth2/v2.0/authorize",
        "access_token_url": "https://login.microsoftonline.com/{{{prompt_directory_id}}}/oauth2/v2.0/token",
        "resource_owner_url": "",
        "scope": "{{{prompt_scope}}}",
        "approval_prompt": ""
      }
    }
  ]
}
